{"w":2400,"h":3170,"lines":[{"y":0.095930232272863458,"c":1,"x":0.086372360751457974,"t":"LIZZIE:","w":0.047984644571940113,"h":0.01162790725659868},{"w":0.03454894383748372,"t":"JOE.","x":0.086372360985014662,"h":0.011627907256598791,"y":0.11337209284180028,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"LIZZIE:","x":0.086372361303281381,"y":0.14389534858100295,"h":0.01162790725659868,"w":0.047984644571940099},{"y":0.17732558139153931,"t":"JOE.","w":0.030710172653198253,"h":0.010174418548680175,"x":0.08829174659086729,"c":1},{"y":0.24127906977230362,"t":"LIZZIE:","x":0.088291747408476742,"w":0.046065257390340161,"c":1,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"t":"JOE:","y":0.25726744183192607,"x":0.086372361712578463,"h":0.010174418548680286,"w":0.032629556655883796,"c":1},{"t":"JOE:","h":0.01162790725659868,"c":1,"w":0.03454894383748372,"y":0.29651162771859996,"x":0.084452975250164097},{"y":0.32848837192079627,"t":"LIZZIE:","x":0.086372361633258135,"w":0.046065257390340189,"h":0.011627907256598569,"c":1},{"x":0.086372360107792853,"w":0.032629559834798177,"h":0.0087209304424489265,"t":"JOE.","y":0.34593023242594123,"c":1},{"w":0.044145873387654633,"h":0.010174418548680286,"t":"LIZZIE:","x":0.088291746534127968,"y":0.40988372092829328,"c":1},{"x":0.086372361712578463,"w":0.032629556655883796,"c":1,"y":0.42587209299471673,"t":"JOE:","h":0.010174418548680286},{"w":0.044218632380167641,"t":"LIZZIE:","h":0.010356781535344139,"y":0.47374602780675135,"c":1,"x":0.088255367038088325},{"w":0.034757757186889643,"y":0.48964560030454196,"c":1,"x":0.084348568563578308,"h":0.011987869070155366,"t":"JOE:"},{"t":"LIZZIE:","y":0.56970777405322448,"x":0.0863461932198923,"w":0.046117595036824541,"c":1,"h":0.011747242298788096},{"x":0.086372360107792853,"t":"JOE.","y":0.58720930232177182,"w":0.032629559834798177,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1},{"y":0.64964510496792427,"c":1,"w":0.046128625869750986,"x":0.086340677372094346,"t":"LIZZIE:","h":0.01320979001018141},{"t":"JOE:","w":0.032629556655883782,"x":0.086372361708700926,"y":0.66715116277243569,"c":1,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"t":"That's good.","h":0.013249211356466839,"y":0.09432176667291392,"w":0.095969289143880226,"x":0.18426103670765046,"c":1},{"w":0.618297373453776,"y":0.10934377619248492,"t":"I'm planning to show them that old film from the 1940s 'Strike Up the Band', and","x":0.18029166704365859,"h":0.020268188139617616,"c":1},{"x":0.18022535653526789,"c":1,"t":"talk about it with the students. What do you think?","y":0.12545052250018918,"w":0.38808835347493481,"h":0.017797171655889565},{"h":0.014581652018550106,"t":"Good idea. As it's about a school band, it might make the students realise how","c":1,"x":0.18426103588152937,"w":0.60460652669270831,"y":0.14384858040893578},{"c":1,"t":"much they can achieve if they work together.","x":0.1841249806587392,"y":0.15802105735458449,"h":0.016117598957819834,"w":0.34195905049641928},{"w":0.61243988037109376,"y":0.17428216175428091,"c":1,"h":0.016397732515064267,"x":0.18418269256706168,"t":"That's what I've got in mind. I'm hoping I can take some of the band to a parade"},{"w":0.56238001505533863,"x":0.18234166215895414,"h":0.013249211356466839,"c":1,"y":0.19179810713938594,"t":"that's going to take place next month. A couple of marching bands will be"},{"t":"performing, and the atmosphere should be quite exciting. It depends on whether I","x":0.18426103389869478,"h":0.013081394761142673,"w":0.62763916015624999,"c":1,"y":0.20784883749811833},{"x":0.182293034901334,"w":0.49339787801106771,"t":"can persuade the school to hire a coach or two to take us there.","h":0.013516139081599876,"c":1,"y":0.22343352262030947},{"t":"Mmm. They sound like good ideas to me.","y":0.23832334213264206,"x":0.18218611909121099,"h":0.01755167843791583,"c":1,"w":0.32086448669433598},{"y":0.25523802473281698,"h":0.011742880066110462,"c":1,"x":0.18398857377834243,"t":"Thanks.","w":0.063933556874593095},{"x":0.18419560795179915,"y":0.29485629148022896,"t":"Can I tell you about a few people in the band who I'm finding it quite difficult to","h":0.015930604784270552,"w":0.59896642049153648,"c":1},{"w":0.4953699747721354,"t":"cope with? I'm sure you'll have some ideas about what I can do.","c":1,"x":0.18226991674451767,"y":0.31063138507256971,"h":0.016420062332875407},{"c":1,"y":0.34132151238239006,"t":"There's a flautist who says she loves playing in the band. We rehearse twice a","x":0.1803132666571195,"w":0.60482711791992183,"h":0.019088295656799925},{"y":0.35878911419380921,"t":"week after school, but she's hardly ever there. Then she looks for me the next","x":0.1803600626811839,"h":0.017088139169975869,"w":0.60281626383463549,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.18229271622885648,"t":"day and gives me a very plausible reason - she says she had to help her mother,","y":0.37500003059726095,"w":0.62774932861328125,"h":0.016006975745553209},{"c":1,"t":"or she's been ill, but to be honest, I don't believe her.","x":0.18234165402702576,"y":0.39242902195044582,"w":0.4088291676839193,"h":0.01324921135646695},{"c":1,"h":0.014598158707002096,"t":"Oh dear! Any more students with difficulties?","x":0.18234164669887776,"y":0.40843023267916356,"w":0.34548945109049478},{"t":"Plenty! There's a trumpeter who thinks she's the best musician in the band,","y":0.42429022095727775,"x":0.18042226632440114,"h":0.014663267286041948,"c":1,"w":0.58157389322916664},{"y":0.44037854894467454,"w":0.59117080688476564,"c":1,"x":0.18042227385375365,"t":"though she certainly isn't. She's always saying what she thinks other people","h":0.014563311387311817},{"t":"should do, which makes my job pretty difficult.","h":0.014582568989943256,"c":1,"y":0.45639534895813183,"x":0.18042226402532427,"w":0.3589251454671224},{"w":0.25527832031249997,"t":"She sounds a bit of a nightmare!","h":0.014826498422712886,"c":1,"x":0.18042226009399723,"y":0.47223974751662201},{"y":0.45873803013679826,"h":0.022691518500776331,"x":0.62273739762124636,"w":0.059210764567057317,"c":1,"t":"IELTS"},{"c":1,"t":"You can say that again. One of the trombonists has got an impressive sense","w":0.58925145467122397,"x":0.18042225718602736,"y":0.48832807551084034,"h":0.014578901104370434},{"h":0.014566979272884528,"y":0.50436046523969891,"c":1,"x":0.18042225672089027,"t":"of rhythm, and could be an excellent musician - except that he has breathing","w":0.59500961303710931},{"t":"difficulties, and he doesn't really have enough breath for the trombone. He'd be","x":0.18042225525755667,"c":1,"y":0.5203488373327565,"h":0.014666935773302026,"w":0.61228408813476554},{"w":0.62380040486653643,"h":0.014594490219741907,"c":1,"t":"much better off playing percussion, for instance, but he refuses to give up. So he","x":0.180422254284582,"y":0.53627760267504709},{"t":"ends up only playing half the notes.","x":0.18042227189289575,"y":0.55232558137593457,"h":0.014551390157513056,"w":0.27831092834472659,"c":1},{"y":0.56831395377714911,"w":0.37428021748860674,"x":0.18042227115050233,"c":1,"t":"I suppose you have to admire his determination.","h":0.013081394761142673},{"t":"Maybe. One of the percussionists isn't too bad, but he never seems to interact","c":1,"h":0.014610079936800635,"w":0.60844528198242187,"y":0.58422712922747799,"x":0.18042227213578846},{"t":"with other people, and he always rushes off as soon as the rehearsal ends. I","x":0.18042227412479567,"h":0.014535800440454327,"c":1,"y":0.60029069779500943,"w":0.59117080688476564},{"x":0.1804222715758857,"y":0.61627906972242408,"c":1,"w":0.61996159871419265,"t":"don't know if there are family reasons, or what. But it isn't good in a band, where","h":0.015988372176979571},{"h":0.016308952355610362,"c":1,"w":0.37830184936523437,"x":0.18226811452589953,"t":"people really need to feel they're part of a group.","y":0.6307481337132963},{"y":0.64830934711172838,"c":1,"h":0.014351531308532173,"w":0.052951294581095376,"t":"Hmm.","x":0.17986097932224007},{"w":0.61036468505859376,"h":0.015988372176979571,"c":1,"t":"There are others too, but at least that gives you an idea of what I'm up against.","y":0.66424418600187751,"x":0.18042226389650068},{"w":0.42418426513671881,"c":1,"h":0.01609474747714934,"t":"Do you have any thoughts about what I can do, Lizzie?","x":0.18234164865535121,"y":0.68012618278888237},{"h":0.014600909621181546,"t":"SECTION 4","y":0.73249211349900789,"x":0.088291746570791405,"w":0.14971209208170572,"c":1},{"x":0.086372360835813997,"t":"As you all know, the university is planning an arts festival for later this year, and here in the","y":0.76151419585797531,"w":0.70057581583658857,"h":0.016102083248294874,"c":1},{"y":0.77760252341353031,"t":"music department we've planned three concerts. These will be public performances, and","w":0.68522074381510423,"h":0.014548639243333494,"c":1,"x":0.086372353800742971},{"w":0.68536692301432289,"y":0.79259894243795337,"t":"the programme has just been finalised. The theme of the festival is links between the UK","h":0.016635786471682734,"x":0.086308650185892954,"c":1},{"x":0.086305185043424423,"y":0.80791543505679686,"w":0.68537480672200524,"c":1,"h":0.01818204633068965,"t":"and Australia, and this is reflected in the music: each concert will feature both British and"},{"x":0.086372382864686306,"y":0.8226744187784244,"c":1,"w":0.71976964314778646,"h":0.017441859681523564,"t":"Australian composers. I'Il tell you briefly about the Australian music, as you probably won't be"},{"c":1,"y":0.84156976729312416,"w":0.13435700734456379,"t":"familiar with that.","h":0.011742535299307133,"x":0.088291745746086059},{"x":0.84261036378535326,"h":0.014550473186119794,"w":0.059500961303710964,"c":1,"t":"Test 3","y":0.047949526661990483},{"w":0.036468331019083644,"h":0.013081394761142562,"c":1,"x":0.81765834880117283,"t":"Q27","y":0.36046511653444235},{"h":0.011627907256598791,"t":"Q28","y":0.44186046494405207,"w":0.036468331019083755,"x":0.81765834879521393,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.50436046537165169,"w":0.036468331019083755,"x":0.81765834878988231,"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"Q29"},{"w":0.036468331019083755,"c":1,"x":0.81765834879521393,"t":"Q30","h":0.01162790725659868,"y":0.5857558137812614},{"w":0.034548943837483637,"c":1,"y":0.9520348838014433,"h":0.014534883469061177,"x":0.86564299439603742,"t":"111"}]}